ncher, defaults.json, markers of existing managed homes migrate transparently); the frozen v1 launch-env-fragment schema enumerates env ids, so the spec task must decide the compatible path (additive enum values plus alias normalization rule, or a versioned schema) without breaking v1 consumers. Then Curator (envregistry, markers, CLI), launcher (curator run claude|codex), relux-root-context packages (validate.sh registered envs, per-env targets/forms) and docs."}}]}
